believe in possibility, equity, and the power of collective care. Your steady support as an Upriser ensures women and gender-diverse people rebuilding their lives after poverty, homelessness, and gender-based violence have someone walking alongside them every step of the way. Through year-long, trauma-informed coaching and wraparound supports, our clients define their goals, reclaim their power, and create lasting stability on their own terms.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-left is-style-default has-custom-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-d70b1225bd50130337d321da17bdb784\">Together we are standing with women across Canada as they rediscover hope, regain their footing, and build lives full of possibility. <strong>Join us in creating a future where every woman and gender-diverse person has opportunities to thrive.<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-getwid-advanced-spacer\" style=\"height:34px\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-getwid-section alignfull is-style-default alignfull getwid-anim fadeIn getwid-section-content-custom-width\" data-wow-duration=\"1500ms\" data-wow-delay=\"200ms\"><div class=\"wp-block-getwid-section__wrapper getwid-padding-top-large getwid-padding-bottom-large getwid-padding-left-medium getwid-padding-right-medium getwid-align-items-mobile-center getwid-justify-content-mobile-center getwid-reset-min-height-mobile\" style=\"min-height:50vh\"><div class=\"wp-block-getwid-section__inner-wrapper\" style=\"max-width:1140px\"><div class=\"wp-block-getwid-section__background-holder\"><div class=\"wp-block-getwid-section__background\" style=\"background-image:url('https:\/\/upwithwomen.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/Client-2-2021-1-e1763405111947.png')\"><div class=\"wp-block-getwid-section__background-image-wrapper\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-block-getwid-section__background-image\" src=\"https:\/\/upwithwomen.org\/wp-cont